  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "Two single Schottky rectifiers in the low, flat eSMP-series SMPC (TO-277A) package, one for 30 V (SS10P3) and one for 40 V (SS10P4) repetitive reverse voltage, each carrying 10 A average forward current with a 280 A surge rating and a guard ring. Typical forward drop at 10 A is 0.48 V at 25 °C; reverse leakage at rated voltage is 100 µA typical at 25 °C. Listed uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and reverse-polarity protection. SS10P4-M3/86A is the 40 V commercial-grade part on 7-inch reel.",
